    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Singular and plural",
     "texto": [
      "**Îmi place cafeaua** means «I like the coffee»; **îmi plac merele**, «I like the apples». **Place** goes with one singular thing and **plac** with several things."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The pronoun",
     "texto": [
      "**Îmi** means «to me». The verb agrees with the food, not with the person who likes it. In English you say «I like coffee» and «I like apples», and the verb «like» does not change."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
